{
    "title": "NBC Sports Bay Area & CA",
    "description": "The NBC Sports Bay Area & CA app is your ultimate teammate! It\u2019s home to your local Bay Area and California team news, game recaps, and highlights for the Golden State Warriors, San Francisco 49ers, San Fransico Giants, Sacramento Kings, Oakland Athletics, and San Jose Sharks.\r\n\r\nNever miss important sports news about your favorite local teams \u2013 whether it\u2019s a milestone moment, notable trade, or key injury \u2013 stay in the know with sports alerts sent right to your phone. Insiders Matt Maiocco, Alex Pavlovic, Monte Poole, and the entire NBC Sports Bay Area & California team will have the latest news, analysis, and insights about your favorite Bay Area teams. Fans can follow live scores, watch pre and post-game interviews and analysis, and customize sports alerts by team. \r\n\r\nThe NBC Sports Bay Area & CA app offers the following features:\r\n\r\n- Access to Warriors, 49ers, Giants, Kings, Athletics, and Sharks highlights, Insider analysis, top headlines, and exclusive offers\r\n- Customized push notifications for sports alerts about the Warriors, 49ers, Giants, Kings, Athletics, and Sharks\r\n- Alerts center that shows you the most urgent Bay Area & California sports news and sports updates of the day that you might\u2019ve missed if you didn\u2019t click on push notifications\r\n- The Latest story feed shows the most up-to-date headlines about your Bay Area & California teams \r\n- A dedicated video section with highlights, pre and post-game interviews & Insider analysis \r\n- The latest scores and stats for your favorite local Bay Area & California teams in the NBA, NFL, MLB and NHL\r\n- Podcasts from your local teams\u2019 most knowledgeable sources\r\n\r\nNBA News and Updates:\r\nGet Golden State Warriors Insider news and updates all season long, including, Warriors pre-season game updates, Christmas Day Game analysis, NBA All-Star news, NBA Playoffs, trade rumors and breaking news, The NBA Finals, NBA Draft, and the NBA Summer League. And don\u2019t forget to sign up for Warriors push notifications for updates on the team and the players. \r\n\r\nNFL News and Updates:\r\nFollow 49ers news and Insider analysis of 49ers training camp, 49ers preseason game updates, NFL Scouting Combine, NFL Draft, Playoff coverage, Super Bowl and Postseason breaking news. Get 49ers push alerts for the full NBC Sports Bay Area experience. \r\n\r\nMLB News and Updates:\r\nGet Insider news and updates for San Fransico Giants spring training, Opening Day, MLB World Classic, MLB Draft, MLB World Tour games updates, All-Star coverage, breaking trade news, World Series coverage, and Post Season. Select Giants push notifications for the latest team and player news. \r\n\r\nCatch the latest news and analysis for Oakland Athletics spring training, Opening Day, MLB World Classic, MLB Draft, MLB World Tour games, All-Star coverage, trade updates, World Series Coverage, and postseason breaking news. Select Athletics push notifications for the latest team and player news. \r\n\r\nNHL News and Updates:\r\nStay updated with the latest San Jose Sharks news and analysis during the Sharks preseason, NHL Draft, All-Star Weekend, Winter Classic, trade rumors, Playoffs, Stanley Cup Finals, and other breaking news. Get Sharks push alerts for the latest player news and team updates. \r\n\r\nNBC Sports Bay Area, a regional sports network, is owned by NBCUniversal as part of the NBCUniversal Local Owned Stations. \r\n\r\nYOUR PRIVACY CHOICES: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/notrtoo?intake=NBC_Sports_Regional_Sports_Network\r\n\r\nCA NOTICE: https://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy/california-consumer-privacy-act?intake=Regional_Sports_Networks",
